This edition changes the Codex account proxy, API-service routing and
fail-closed behavior; adds encrypted proxy inventory and group failover,
Hysteria2/TUIC and subscription import, request observability and UI controls;
and adds Windows build and acceptance-test tooling. It is not an official
release of the upstream project, OpenAI, Xray-core, or sing-box.

