  Binary/license are downloaded by build.cmd; source:
  https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/tree/v26.3.27
- sing-box v1.14.1: GNU General Public License v3 or later, subject to its
  additional name/non-affiliation notice. The installer carries its license,
  GPL-3.0 text and the corresponding upstream source archive. The source
